{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ScanKit 是一款快速、現代化的文件掃描工具，能自動偵測文件邊緣、校正透視並提升影像品質，幾秒內完成掃描、整理與分享。適合學生、專業人士、自由工作者、教師及小型企業使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-102.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自動邊緣偵測與清晰掃描</h2>\n<p>ScanKit 具備自動文件邊緣偵測、智能自動裁剪與透視校正，支援多頁連續掃描及從相簿匯入相片。內建去除陰影、提升文字清晰度與黑白、彩色、灰階等多種模式，亦可調整亮度、對比及銳利度。它能建立多頁 PDF、重新排序或壓縮頁面，並透過 OCR 擷取文字，方便搜尋、複製與分享。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-548-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-549-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-550-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-551-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-552-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-553-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ScanKit: Document &amp; QR Scanner</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/scankit-document-qr-scanner/id6789805312?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:00:50.675191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:11.752631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:32.048818+00:00","content_hash":"935ca148af3b3822bc803f1e8c21ddc6a981a19128de98591a94228b658622e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:00:50.675191+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}